{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the world of NOX AETERNA - Veil of Darkness\u00a0\ud83e\udd87</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A thoughtful but humorous text adventure about a teenage boy, a little, but ancient vampire girl, and the machinations of an immortal parallel society. \ud83d\udc41\ufe0f\u200d\ud83d\udde8\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you'll experience a mix of <strong>thoughtful </strong>as well as philosophical<strong> </strong>and often\u00a0<strong>humorous </strong>dialogues. You forge new friendships and uncover <strong>secrets</strong>\u00a0that were meant to remain hidden from the human world forever. Your <strong>decisions</strong> determine the course of the story.\u00a0\ud83d\udcac</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally: You ever wanted to play a <i><strong>text adventure inside a text adventure</strong></i>? </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then <strong>this is your chance now</strong>\u00a0to play the cool game your friend Jens has programmed \ud83d\ude35\u200d\ud83d\udcab</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single play through will take 1..2 hours, but <span class=\"bb_strike\">you can</span>\u00a0<strong>you will want</strong> to\u00a0play it through multiple times to explore more lore along different story paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436630/extras/84304570ff614120664ddb2220675c7f.avif?t=1759506609\" width=1560 height=890 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TL;DR:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short</strong>, but dense narration with <strong>replay</strong> value</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can even play a <strong>game within a game</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uses sound and music to enhance immersion</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game <strong>automatically saves</strong> at any time </p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Began your journey","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3436630/4baebe4918eff9e06c4135f7523527eda994907c.jpg"},{"name":"The dream","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3436630/e673bacc5fc5bf114ac3a36ecaa0b11b0d4d6e10.jpg"},{"name":"It could also save your life","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3436630/c0bc84e68c5b5a4aa99352edfea46bf4fa9943c4.jpg"},{"name":"Bad tree","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3436630/32a900db22091537fffe4b820cea3aba569e37c6.jpg"},{"name":"Bitten","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3436630/23e3ff3189a8981ad23a2d6e1085974cfd8673a1.jpg"},{"name":"Text adventure","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3436630/bbf70c1141ab60bc43edccbc128095756f5c3160.jpg"},{"name":"Well educated","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3436630/047df6604123fa1d323a44239cad40c79c056dd9.jpg"},{"name":"Got lost","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3436630/86e72bf1a1faed0b433982717f841b1b6df35476.jpg"},{"name":"Got hypnotized","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3436630/f10c4aeeaad4028fa39e725753765d164f6281e7.jpg"},{"name":"Shouldn't have asked","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3436630/069339c8c800731f89c9f748847ae01cf0bf2098.jpg"}],"total":10},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3436630?t=1759506609","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic